    "body": "@domenic I noticed that you said <q>We don't have any plans to......</q> in your first reply. And I also noticed that the content in the hyperlink in your reply above says <q>......Those editors read all the feedback, and, taking it into account along with research, studies, and feedback from many other sources (blogs, forums, IRC, etc.)......</q>.\r\n\r\nPlease allow me to ask you a question: have you really discussed with other editors and read all the feedback, and, taking it into account along with research, studies, and feedback from many other sources about this proposal before closing it?",
